.TH MYSTRCAT 3 "September 2026" "BSDSF23M009-OS-A01" "Library Functions"
.SH NAME
mystrcat \- concatenate two strings
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int mystrcat(char *" dest ", const char *" src );
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mystrcat()
function appends the string pointed to by
.I src
to the end of the string pointed to by
.I dest.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the total length of the resulting concatenated string.
.SH AUTHOR
Written by Alisha (BSDSF23M009).
